      "status": "draft_review_required",
      "native_reviewer_approved": false,
      "expert_approved": false,
      "rights_reviewed": false,
      "meaning_reviewed": false,
      "reviewer_note_tr": "al-maġḍūbi ʿalayhim / aḍ-ḍāllīn: özne ve yorum çağrışımları, etnik/dinî grup ataması olmadan kaynak ve uzman görüşüyle kontrol edilmeli."
    },
    "ikhlas:1": {
      "surah_id": "ikhlas",
      "ayah_number": 1,
      "source_ayah_key": "ikhlas:1",
      "source_arabic_text": "قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ",
      "source_audio_path": "assets/quran/audio/ikhlas/ihlas_1.mp3",
      "text": "Sprich: Allah ist der Eine, der Einzige.",
      "language": "de",
      "status": "draft_review_required",
      "native_reviewer_approved": false,
      "expert_approved": false,
      "rights_reviewed": false,
      "meaning_reviewed": false,
      "reviewer_note_tr": "Ahad: tek ve eşsiz olma vurgusu; 'der Eine, der Einzige' lafızların eşitliği değil yorumlayıcı anlam aktarımıdır. Dinî uzman incelesin."
    },
    "ikhlas:2": {
      "surah_id": "ikhlas",
      "ayah_number": 2,
      "source_ayah_key": "ikhlas:2",
      "source_arabic_text": "ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ",
      "source_audio_path": "assets/quran/audio/ikhlas/ihlas_2.mp3",
      "text": "Allah ist auf niemanden angewiesen; alle sind auf Ihn angewiesen.",
      "language": "de",
      "status": "draft_review_required",
      "native_reviewer_approved": false,
      "expert_approved": false,
      "rights_reviewed": false,
      "meaning_reviewed": false,
      "reviewer_note_tr": "As-Samad: muhtaç olmama ve bütün varlığın O'na muhtaç olması açıklayıcı/yorumlayıcı çeviridir; tefsir ve mezhep duyarlılığıyla uzman incelesin."
    },
    "ikhlas:3": {
      "surah_id": "ikhlas",
      "ayah_number": 3,
      "source_ayah_key": "ikhlas:3",
      "source_arabic_text": "لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ",
      "source_audio_path": "assets/quran/audio/ikhlas/ihlas_3.mp3",
      "text": "Er hat keine Nachkommen gezeugt und wurde selbst nicht gezeugt.",
      "language": "de",
      "status": "draft_review_required",
      "native_reviewer_approved": false,
      "expert_approved": false,
      "rights_reviewed": false,
      "meaning_reviewed": false,
      "reviewer_note_tr": "Lam yalid wa-lam yulad: 'zeugt nicht/wurde nicht gezeugt' yönü korunmalı; 'Nachkommen' tercihi kapsam açısından incelensin."
    },
    "ikhlas:4": {
      "surah_id": "ikhlas",
      "ayah_number": 4,
      "source_ayah_key": "ikhlas:4",
      "source_arabic_text": "وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ",
      "source_audio_path": "assets/quran/audio/ikhlas/ihlas_4.mp3",
      "text": "Und niemand ist Ihm in irgendeiner Weise ebenbürtig.",
      "language": "de",
      "status": "draft_review_required",
      "native_reviewer_approved": false,
      "expert_approved": false,
      "rights_reviewed": false,
      "meaning_reviewed": false,
      "reviewer_note_tr": "Kufuwan ahad: Allah'a hiç kimsenin denk olmadığı; 'in irgendeiner Weise' yorumlayıcı genişlemesinin doğruluğu incelensin."
    },
    "falaq:1": {
      "surah_id": "falaq",
      "ayah_number": 1,
      "source_ayah_key": "falaq:1",
      "source_arabic_text": "قُلْ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلْفَلَقِ",
      "source_audio_path": "assets/quran/audio/falaq/felak_1.mp3",
      "text": "Sprich: Ich suche Schutz beim Herrn des anbrechenden Morgens,",
      "language": "de",
      "status": "draft_review_required",
      "native_reviewer_approved": false,
      "expert_approved": false,
      "rights_reviewed": false,
      "meaning_reviewed": false,
      "reviewer_note_tr": "Al-Falaq: Tagesanbruch/Morgendämmerung; Übersetzung 'anbrechender Morgen' gegenüber 'Tagesanbruch' auf Genauigkeit prüfen."
